  "bio": "Blackjax Tattoo Shack, nestled in the heart of Chandler, Arizona, is a creative art hub that specializes in avant-garde Trashpolka, intricate Black&Gray, and hyper-realistic tattoos. With a combination of raw talent and precision, this eclectic studio curates ambitious designs, inviting its clientele to embrace a blend of tradition and modernity inked with absolute care. Their doors are always open for bookings at 594 N Arizona Ave, reachable at 623.703.TAT2.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location:\n\nFREEHAND TATTOO ARTIST\nTATTOO APPT # (623) 703 - 8282\n594 N ARIZONA AVE CHANDLER AZ 85225",
